e that the gene was found essential and gray indicates non-essentiality. White boxes represent genes that are not targeted by the respective library. (B) siRNA knockdown of the FANCL and FANCE expression using four individual siRNAs each in the HAP1 Cas9 bulk and HAP1 Cas9 SCC11 and SCC12 cell lines. A pool of non-targeting siRNAs was used as a control. Surviving cells were stained with crystal violet solution. (C) Same as (B) for FANCG and FANCM expression. Representative images from four independent experiments conducted for each condition are shown. nt ctrl\u2009=\u2009non targeting control.", "funding": "de.NBi BMBF", "funding_list": [{"id": 19470501, "title": "de.NBi BMBF", "grant_code": "", "funder_name": null, "is_user_defined": 1}], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 3406994, "created_date": "2020-11-24T04:55:30Z", "modified_date": "2026-03-08T09:19:27Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 47, "name": "CC BY + CC0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["CRISPR/Cas9", "Genetic screens", "sgRNA design", "Gene essentiality", "Functional genomics"], "keywords": ["CRISPR/Cas9", "Genetic screens", "sgRNA design", "Gene essentiality", "Functional genomics"], "categories": [{"id": 13, "title": "Genetics", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}], "references": ["https://doi.org/10.1038/nrg1291", "https://doi.org/10.1038/nrg2364", "https://doi.org/10.1038/nrg.2017.97", "https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1225829", "https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1232033", "https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1246981", "https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1247005", "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2015.11.015", "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2015.02.038", "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2015.02.038", "https://doi.org/10.1158/2159-8290.CD-16-0154", "https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aah7111", "https://doi.org/10.1038/ng.3984", "ht